    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-1234-567890abcdef",
        "name": "POS Backend API",
        "description": "Postman collection for the Multi-Shop Point of Sale System API with RBAC and Multi-Tenant support.\n\n**Roles:**\n- super_admin: Full system access\n- admin: Business-level administrator\n- manager: Branch-level manager\n- employee: Shop-level employee\n- auditor: Read-only auditor\n\n**Role Creation Rules:**\n- Users cannot create roles above their own\n- Users cannot create users with their own role (only beneath)\n- Super Admin: can create admin, manager, employee, auditor\n- Admin: can create manager, employee, auditor (NOT admin)\n- Manager: can create employee, auditor (NOT manager)\n- Auditor/Employee: cannot create users",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
